WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.440
- So I heard that someone famous

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:02.610
showed up at your wedding

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:04.290
that your mom was more excited about

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:05.230
than you getting married.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.063
(Jay and Kelly laughing)

00:00:06.063 --> 00:00:07.710
- Yeah so I've known Anna Kendrick,

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:10.260
we were introduced through
a good friend of ours,

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:14.070
Tommy Alter, who hosts this
podcast with JJ Redick.

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:16.140
And we were out at dinner one night

00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.670
and we were all talking about summer plans

00:00:17.670 --> 00:00:18.503
and everyone was like,

00:00:18.503 --> 00:00:19.830
"Oh I'mma be in Europe.
I'mma be in Europe."

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:20.790
And we're like okay cool.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.370
Like if we see each other, sure
we'll bump into each other.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:27.093
Literally she was in Florence
the weekend of my wedding.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.629
- [Kelly] What?
- Yeah she knew the date.

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:30.462
She knew the date.

00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:31.571
- She was like, "Oh that's so weird."

00:00:31.571 --> 00:00:32.610
- Anna knew the date but-

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:34.980
- She's a wedding crasher, I like it.

00:00:34.980 --> 00:00:37.470
- I'm not gonna say
that, but no, but no so-

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:39.870
- I wanna say that, that
makes her even more lovable.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:41.040
It's awesome.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:42.930
- She came, she was a champ.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:46.350
She actually came as like a plus one

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.720
to this like kickoff
drinks thing that we did

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:51.150
like two days before the
wedding with a buddy of mine.

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:51.983
And I was like,

00:00:51.983 --> 00:00:53.340
"You gotta come to the
wedding, you're in town.

00:00:53.340 --> 00:00:54.660
How crazy is this? You gotta come."

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.540
Like how random is it that
you're in the same place? Come.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:59.070
She's like, "I can't
do it. I won't do it."

00:00:59.070 --> 00:01:00.217
And I'm like-

00:01:00.217 --> 00:01:01.230
"I can't find a dress."

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:02.490
You're in Italy, you can find a dress.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:03.323
- Yes.

00:01:03.323 --> 00:01:04.590
- It's dresses everywhere in
Italy, you can find a dress.

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.450
So finally she gets to the wedding

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:08.040
and literally after the ceremony,

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.530
my mom walks over to me
and pulls me to the side

00:01:10.530 --> 00:01:13.246
and my mom is like, "Did you
know Anna Kendrick was here?"

00:01:13.246 --> 00:01:14.079
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:14.079 --> 00:01:14.912
And I was like, "Yeah mom."

00:01:14.912 --> 00:01:15.745
- Well it is my wedding.
- And she's like,

00:01:15.745 --> 00:01:16.745
"I took a picture with her."

00:01:16.745 --> 00:01:17.578
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:17.578 --> 00:01:18.780
And I was like, "Mom I just got married.

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:19.650
Literally, I just got married."

00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:20.850
- So let's just, perspective.

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:21.683
- Let's just-

00:01:21.683 --> 00:01:22.516
- Bring it in.

00:01:22.516 --> 00:01:23.477
- We're still at the
wedding, just so you know.

00:01:23.477 --> 00:01:24.310
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:24.310 --> 00:01:25.143
But it was a good time.

00:01:25.143 --> 00:01:27.240
- We're supposed to be up
here in importance right now.

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:28.590
She's like, "I'm over you."

